identifiers:
  - type: url
    value: "https://github.com/attractor-set/torch2pc-layerwise-thesis/releases/tag/v1.0.0"
    description: "GitHub Release for the final thesis v1.0.0 publication state."
abstract: >
  Software, evidence, and dissertation sources for a protocol-first study of
  backpropagation and predictive-coding regimes in Torch2PC. The work separates
  final behavior, internal mechanism, compute cost, task-relative action
  admissibility, pre-action recognizability, and full decision-cost economics;
  it introduces the PC-TREF and PC-CATM theoretical levels and evaluates the
  bounded QWake-FP FixedPred realization.
keywords:
  - predictive coding
  - backpropagation
  - Torch2PC
  - PC-TREF
  - PC-CATM
  - QWake-FP
  - reproducibility
  - representation similarity
  - computational cost
  - ROCm
